      "description": "Labeled search input on the native Spotlight-style dialog surface.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-field\"><svg class=\"ds-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"10.5\" cy=\"10.5\" r=\"6.5\"/><path d=\"m16 16 5 5\"/></svg><input class=\"ds-search\" type=\"search\" aria-label=\"Search concept names and descriptions\" placeholder=\"What would you like to explore?\"/></label>",
