      "refersTo": "example-row-selected",
      "description": "Selected example with an honest implementation state.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-row\" href=\"/concepts/input-output/example-1\" aria-current=\"page\"><span class=\"ds-file\"><svg class=\"ds-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 2H5a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v18a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h14a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V8Z\"/><path d=\"M14 2v6h6m-12 5h8m-8 4h5\"/></svg><span>C#</span></span><span class=\"ds-row-text\">Example 01<small>Not implemented yet</small></span><svg class=\"ds-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 5 7 7-7 7\"/></svg></a>",
      "css": ".ds-row{font-family:var(--font,Geist,'Segoe UI',sans-serif);display:flex;align-items:center;padding:12px 9px;gap:10px;border-radius:7px;min-height:65px;max-width:235px;color:var(--ink,#24354a);text-decoration:none;background:#f2f6fa}.ds-row:hover{background:#e4edf8}.ds-row[aria-current=page]{background:#dceafb}.ds-file{position:relative;width:29px;height:35px;flex-shrink:0;color:#6481a4}.ds-file>.ds-icon{width:29px;height:35px;stroke-width:1.2}.ds-file>span{position:absolute;left:7px;top:16px;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#3f729c;background:#dceafb}.ds-row-text{font-size:12px;font-weight:550;line-height:1.6}.ds-row-text small{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--muted,#566b83);font-weight:400}.ds-row>.ds-icon{margin-left:auto;width:12px;height:12px;color:#8d9eb3}.ds-icon{width:20px;height:20px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.7;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;flex-shrink:0}.ds-link:focus-visible,.ds-plain:focus-visible,.ds-search:focus-visible,.ds-sidebar:focus-visible,.ds-row:focus-visible,.ds-dock-item:focus-visible,.ds-folder:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #1979df;outline-offset:4px}"
